 41: ## 🏗️ Architecture & Workflow
 42: 
 43: ```
 44: [ Filesystem Event ] (watchdog)
 45:         │
 46:         ▼
 47: [ Noise & Internal Filter ] ──> Ignore own logs, .git, OS metadata (~$*, .tmp, desktop.ini)
 48:         │
 49:         ▼
 50: [ Write-Burst Debounce ] ────> Suppress rapid OS buffer flushes within debounce window
 51:         │
 52:         ▼
 53: [ Event Classification ] ────> Check Sensitive Extensions / Directories & Suspicious Destinations
 54:         │                       ├── CRITICAL: Sensitive file moved to USB/Cloud/Network or Deleted
 55:         │                       ├── WARNING : Sensitive file Created/Modified
 56:         │                       └── INFO    : Normal file activity
 57:         │
 58:         ▼
 59: [ Integrity Hashing ] ───────> Compute SHA-256 (pre/post transfer comparison)
 60:         │
 61:         ├───> [ Structured Logger ] ───> logs/audit.log (JSON Lines) + Console
 62:         ├───> [ Alerter ] ─────────────> logs/alerts.log + Terminal Banner
 63:         ├───> [ Native Toast Notifier ]> Windows Notification Center
 64:         └───> [ Desktop / Web UI ] ────> Native Desktop Window or http://localhost:5000
 65: ```
