145: ## 💻 Usage
146: 
147: ### 1. Launch the Native Windows Desktop App (Default)
148: ```bash
149: python main.py
150: # or
151: python main.py --desktop
152: # or
153: python app_desktop.py
154: ```
155: * Spawns a dedicated native window with the live SPLUNK-style dashboard.
156: * Adds a shield icon to the **Windows System Tray** (near the taskbar clock).
157: * Minimizing or closing the window keeps monitoring active in the background.
158: * Triggers native **Windows Toast Notifications** whenever a suspicious file event occurs.
159: * Clicking any log row opens the **Vertical Incident Report Drawer in chat block form**.
